    (1594,1566,'Treatment will be considered to have failed if two or more of the five cultures recorded in the final 12 months of therapy are positive, or if any one of the final three cultures is positive. (Definition from WHO Guidelines for the programmatic management of drug-resistant tuberculosis)','en',12,'2006-08-31 17:00:26.0',12,null,'eceab5ea-07fe-102c-b5fa-0017a47871b2'),
