    (2491,2723,'Should the patient start to use a mosquito net?  Mosquito nets to prevent malaria come treated with insecticide and untreated. In malaria endemic areas adults and children should sleep under a treated mosquito net to raise the safety bar and prevent malaria and other infectious diseases.','en',7,'2007-10-15 16:43:34.0',1,null,'ecf5430c-07fe-102c-b5fa-0017a47871b2'),
