    (2497,2729,'The circulatory system (or cardiovascular system) is an organ system that moves nutrients, gases, and wastes to and from cells, and helps stabilize body temperature and pH to maintain homeostasis.','en',7,'2007-10-17 11:20:00.0',24839,null,'ecf54eec-07fe-102c-b5fa-0017a47871b2'),
