    (2531,2854,'Hepatotoxicity (from hepatic toxicity) implies chemical-driven liver damage. The liver plays a central role in transforming and clearing chemicals and is susceptible to the toxicity from these agents. Certain medicinal agents when taken in overdoses and sometime even when introduced within therapeutic ranges may injure the organ.','en',7,'2007-11-21 12:49:32.0',24839,null,'ecf5960e-07fe-102c-b5fa-0017a47871b2'),
