    (3967,3230,'Obesity is a condition in which the natural energy reserve, stored in the fatty tissue of humans and other mammals, exceeds healthy limits.','en',7,'2008-06-18 17:06:32.0',7,'2011-06-29 20:09:04.0','ed233ae6-07fe-102c-b5fa-0017a47871b2'),
    (3968,3231,'Abnormally fast breathing. A respiratory rate that is too rapid. The normal rate of respirations (breaths per minute) depends on a number of factors, including the age of the individual and the degree of exertion.','en',7,'2008-06-18 17:09:00.0',7,'2011-06-29 20:09:04.0','ed233cee-07fe-102c-b5fa-0017a47871b2'),
    (3969,3232,'This is when a patient uses additional muscles in addition to the intercostals and diaphram to inhale or exhale. An example is that some people will raise their shoulders in order to increase the volume of the chest, increasing the tidal volume of each breath.','en',7,'2008-06-18 17:14:19.0',12,'2011-08-08 19:55:31.0','ed233ef6-07fe-102c-b5fa-0017a47871b2'),
    (3970,3233,'General Exam Finding other than those provided. Open Text. ','en',7,'2008-06-18 11:17:18.0',5,null,'ed2340fe-07fe-102c-b5fa-0017a47871b2'),
    (3971,3234,'Pink eye is the most obvious symptom of conjunctivitis, which involves inflammation of the clear membrane covering the white part of the eye and interior lining of the eyelids. Pink eye can refer to all types of conjunctivitis, or just to its contagious forms.','en',1,'2008-06-18 17:25:04.0',1,'2011-08-08 19:55:33.0','ed2342f2-07fe-102c-b5fa-0017a47871b2'),
    (3972,3235,'The jugular venous pressure (JVP, sometimes referred to as jugular venous pulse) is the indirectly observed pressure over the venous system. It can be useful in the differentiation of different forms of heart and lung disease.','en',24839,'2008-06-18 17:29:19.0',1,'2011-08-08 19:55:35.0','ed249bf2-07fe-102c-b5fa-0017a47871b2'),
