    (5281,6821,'Mental retardation (MR) is a generalized disorder, characterized by significantly impaired cognitive functioning and deficits in two or more adaptive behaviors with onset before the age of 18.','en',12,'2010-07-22 00:40:03.0',24839,'2011-11-17 15:52:29.0','68459d65-abdb-4967-9f93-b671f40fafb7'),
