    (5284,6824,'Facial weakness is a medical sign associated with a variety of medical conditions. Conditions include stroke, neurofibromatosis, Bell\'s palsy, Ramsay Hunt syndrome, Spontaneous cerebrospinal fluid leak.','en',6,'2010-07-22 00:46:27.0',5,'2011-11-17 15:52:25.0','12880e8d-0712-4255-a77f-7799f2877313'),
