    (5290,6830,'Partial or complete loss of consciousness with interruption of awareness of oneself and ones surroundings. When the loss of consciousness is temporary and there is spontaneous recovery, it is referred to as syncope or, in nonmedical quarters, fainting.','en',7,'2010-07-21 19:32:50.0',6,'2012-09-26 22:16:24.0','11adbba0-83fb-4779-9b2c-b61699f361fe'),
